        "text": "Distance from D to C (64,48):\n\nsqrt[(64 - 30)^2 + (48 - 80/3)^2] = sqrt[34^2 + (48 - 26.666...)^2] = sqrt[1156 + (21.333...)^2]\n\nCompute 21.333... squared: 21.333... is 64/3, so (64/3)^2 = 4096/9 ≈ 455.111...\n\nSo, sqrt[1156 + 4096/9] = sqrt[(10404/9) + (4096/9)] = sqrt[14500/9] = sqrt(14500)/3 = (10*sqrt(145))/3. Same as before."
      },
