        "text": "Dividing 0.175 by 0.325:\n\nFirst, 0.325 goes into 0.175 how many times? Let's see:\n\n0.325 * 0.5 = 0.1625\n\nSubtract that from 0.175: 0.175 - 0.1625 = 0.0125\n\nNow, 0.325 goes into 0.0125 approximately 0.04 times (since 0.325 * 0.04 = 0.013, which is close to 0.0125)\n\nSo, approximately 0.5 + 0.04 = 0.54"
