        "text": "Maybe include ramps for the play area, or at least have a sign that explains the layout for those with mobility issues. Also, the lighting should be accessible, so maybe include some floodlights or at least have a clear path to the shade areas."
      },
      {
        "label": "initializing",
        "text": "I should also think about the design elements."
      },
      {
